{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7667143595024222517","title":"Unity客户端开发工程师 - 抖音直播","description":"团队介绍：直播团队负责为抖音集团旗下产品提供直播服务。团队负责直播平台技术和直播业务研发，打造灵活稳定的直播服务平台，为用户提供优质直播体验，支持电商、本地生活、游戏、节目、多人互动等不同类型的业务场景。直播业务发展迅猛，处于行业头部地位，业务发展空间巨大。现在加入我们，和优秀的人一起做有挑战的事，你的技术与创意将影响亿级用户，激发创意和丰富生活。\n\n1、负责Unity3D社交项目的客户端重要功能模块开发；\n2、负责开发游戏所需的相关工具、插件的开发及相关SDK的接入；\n3、参与Unity3D社交项目的性能分析和优化。","requirement":"1、2027届获得本科及以上学历，计算机相关专业优先；\n2、熟练掌握C++，熟练运用C#，Lua语言撰写客户端代码；\n3、有Unity编辑器开发经验，熟悉Unity编辑器扩展。","job_category":{"id":"6704215957146962184","name":"客户端","en_name":"Client","i18n_name":"客户端","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"6704215862603155720","name":"研发","en_name":"R\u0026D","i18n_name":"研发","depth":1,"children":[]},"children":[]},"city_info":{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","i18n_name":"北京"},"recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1785146123511,"channel_online_status":1,"job_subject":{"id":"7649336829398468869","name":{"zh_cn":"2027届校园招聘","i18n":"2027届校园招聘"},"active_status":1},"code":"A243183A","job_id":"7667143532436179253","city_list":[{"code":"CT_11","name":"北京","en_name":"Beijing","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"北京","py_name":"beijing","mdm_code":"MDCY00000001","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_125","name":"上海","en_name":"Shanghai","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"上海","py_name":"shanghai","mdm_code":"MDCY00000002","node_status":1},{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"sel